2026-05-01T11:13:33.913Z JOY-013D-5B comment.added "Implemented in commit 1df5442.\n\nChanges in `crates/joy-cli/src/commands/ai.rs`:\n\n- [x] Introduced `DocPathSource` enum and `ResolvedDoc` struct so callers know whether a path came from a flag, project.yaml, auto-detection, or an interactive prompt.\n- [x] `resolve_doc_path` now takes the first existing candidate silently as `AutoDetected` and only prompts when nothing is detected.\n- [x] `check_docs` annotates auto-detected paths with `(auto-detected)` next to the checkmark and prints a one-line tip referencing `joy project set docs.<key> <path>` when at least one path was auto-detected.\n- [x] `check_docs` validates configured paths: when the file is missing but a candidate exists at a different location, it offers `Switch to <suggestion>? [Y/n]` instead of creating a duplicate template at the stale path.\n- [x] Updated existing unit tests for the new return type and added two regression tests: `auto_detects_existing_candidate_without_prompt` and `auto_detects_default_path_when_present`.\n\nVerification: `cargo test --workspace --lib --features fast-kdf` (297 passed), `cargo test -p joy-cli --test cmd --features fast-kdf` (snapshots green), `cargo clippy -p joy-cli --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean." [ai:claude@joy delegated-by:horst.schwarz@joydev.com]
